             PGM
/*   SETS LOGICAL DATA AREA TO EXECUTE THE TPURGE PROGRAM TO  */
/*   DELETE WORK ORDERS FROM THE SYSTEM                       */
             CHGDTAARA  DTAARA(*LDA (301 1)) VALUE('1')
             CALL TPURGE
/*           CHGDTAARA  DTAARA(*LDA (301 1)) VALUE(' ')       */
             ENDPGM
